Package: mapmap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: video projection mapping editor
 MapMap is a free video mapping software for artists and small teams.
 Draw quads, triangles, meshes and ellipses over the surfaces you project
 on, then fill them with video, images, colours or a camera feed.
